**Scope rule.** `crates/engine/src/types/game_state.rs` (new accessor methods including the pool resolver; the library-knowledge epoch functions and `LibraryKnowledgeStamp` are defined here); `crates/engine/src/game/zones.rs`; `crates/engine/src/game/library.rs`; `crates/engine/src/game/engine_resolution_choices.rs`; `crates/engine/src/game/effects/conjure.rs`; `crates/engine/src/game/deck_loading.rs`; `crates/engine/src/game/visibility.rs` (the library-knowledge key call sites only); `crates/engine-wasm/src/lib.rs` (boot-guard function only); `crates/engine/src/game/effects/draw.rs` (`select_cards_to_draw`); `crates/engine/src/game/mulligan.rs` (`shuffle_hand_into_library`, `draw_n`); a new integration test file under `crates/engine/tests/integration/` with its `mod` line in `tests/integration/main.rs`.

